{"availability":"available","full":"defoebrand/Alien-Invasion","name":"Alien-Invasion","description":"This project is the Microverse JavaScript Capstone project. It was created using Phaser 3 to be in the style of a Shooter game. It is compiled using webpack and deployed with Netlify. It takes keyboard input, uses multiple scenes, and connects to a LeaderBoard API.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":22,"forks":1,"created":"2020-11-30T09:08:32Z","updated":"2020-12-08T13:24:24Z","branch":"development","homepage":"https://quirky-nobel-917e25.netlify.app/","topics":["javascript","microverse-projects","netlify","phaser3","webpack"],"demo":"https://quirky-nobel-917e25.netlify.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:58.371Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:58.371Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:58.371Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T09:11:58.371Z","stars":22,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This project is the Microverse JavaScript Capstone project. It was created using Phaser 3 to be in the style of a Shooter game. It is compiled using webpack and deployed with Netlify. It takes keyboard input, uses multiple scenes, and connects to a LeaderBoard API.","The year is 2021. The New Year's celebrations just finished dying down when huge explosions seem to be heard simultaneously around the world. Before you even have time to look up you see bright beams of light shining all over the ground and people, dumbfounded, stare up into them like deer on a dark road. Good thing you have your trusty 'Rusty' shotgun with you. You hear an explosion and see an alien get shot, throwing a grenade before blowing himself up! Soldiers in hardened full-body suits start showing up out of nowhere and you know it's time! It's 2020 part 2: 2021! Alien Invasion!"],"features":["Loading screen progress bar with background art","Arrow pointer for easy menu selection","Dynamic level creation every third round","Points awarded for each round cleared","Enemies chase player based on x position"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/defoebrand/Alien-Invasion/blob/development/README.md","fingerprint":"9ca85229d1d62d38000c589974908b78bc49969779ad4a0150599da7aaa5de2f","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:58.501Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:58.501Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This project is the Microverse JavaScript Capstone project. It was created using Phaser 3 to be in the style of a Shooter game. It is compiled using webpack and deployed with Netlify. It takes keyboard input, uses multiple scenes, and connects to a LeaderBoard API.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/defoebrand/Alien-Invasion/blob/development/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"9ca85229d1d62d38000c589974908b78bc49969779ad4a0150599da7aaa5de2f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/defoebrand/Alien-Invasion/blob/development/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:58.501Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2020-12-08T13:24:24Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/defoebrand/Alien-Invasion/blob/development/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:58.502Z","hash":"9ca85229d1d62d38000c589974908b78bc49969779ad4a0150599da7aaa5de2f","originalBytes":5740,"storedBytes":5740,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["round","enemies","project","run","leaderboard","every","step","alien","game","npm","press","screen","selection","character","cleared","credits","destroyed","directional","each","enter","gameplay","get","microverse","open","pad","player","scenes","see","tests","them","additional","api","art","avoid","before","begin","bombs","browser","chase","defoebrand","down","enemy","features","ground","help","input","install","invasion","issue","javascript","jest","jump","just","license","licensed","loading","local","name","navigate","new","options","out","over","packages","points","quickplay","seconds","set","shooting","shot","sp